invariant: INV-16
file: Makefile
catches: test/lint-trust-separation.sh
reason: the Makefile takes X25519=wide beside WIDEMUL=runtime, and ct.h's
  refusal then stops the compile rather than the configuration.
  lint-trust-separation's refused row requires make print-lib-def to
  fail for that pair.

--- old
ifeq ($(X25519),wide)
$(error WIDEMUL=runtime asks each session for the multiply's timing, and X25519=wide states it at build time; use X25519=portable)
endif
--- new
